OL,3,GNEWSAAssisted dying is now law - what
OL,4,Ahappens next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the law to legalise assisted dying
OL,7,Fgranted Royal Assent on Tuesday, it
OL,8,Fwould be reasonable for people to think
OL,9,Fa service is just around the corner.
OL,11,FThe reality is that the legislation's
OL,12,Fapproval marks the start of a lengthy
OL,13,Fprocess of consultations, secondary
OL,14,Flegislation and logistical planning
OL,15,Fbefore assisted dying can be introduced
OL,16,Fon the Isle of Man.
OL,18,FThe work is expected to take at least
OL,19,F18 months, in line with the timeline
OL,20,Ffor implementing the island's capacity
OL,21,Flegislation.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
