OL,3,GNEWSAAssisted dying is now law - what
OL,4,Ahappens next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce introduced, assisted dying will
OL,7,Fallow eligible terminally ill Manx
OL,8,Fresidents to choose to end their lives
OL,9,Fwith medical assistance.
